-- V4__seed_firm40.sql
--
-- Seed data for FIRM_CD=40 ("ClearPath") — same approach as V2 (firm 1). Firm 40
-- is a household-based firm: one household with two clients and three accounts
-- holding real positions. Makes the platform functional for advisor tim40.
--
-- Provenance : extracted from PROD (192.168.1.42 / ORCL12VM, schema GP), then
--              PII-SCRUBBED for this public repo (IDs/codes/relationships real;
--              names, emails, tax ids, password hash synthetic/blanked).
-- Generated  : 2026-06-01. Applies on top of V1 (baseline), V2 (firm 1), V3 (firm 3).
--
-- Scope (<=10 rows per table): 1 firm, 4 entities (advisor tim40 + 1 household +
-- 2 clients), 3 accounts (+account_details), 6 entity-account roles, 6 policy
-- grants, 8 instruments, 10 positions.
--
-- LOGIN (tim40 / gwAdmin): LDAP_UID='tim40', GW_ADMIN_FLAG=1, MFA off, active.
-- Password NOT committed (LDAP_PSWD_HASH blanked); SAML login via email auto-link
-- (tim40@geowealth.int — adjust to match the P1 user).
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------


